1
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Unpolished. Unkempt. Unleashed. Undercover.

2
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Miss Congeniality is a comedy, crime, action film directed by Donald Petrie.

3
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
When the local FBI office receives a letter from a terrorist known only as 'The Citizen', it's
quickly determined that he's planning his next act at the Miss America beauty pageant.

4
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Because tough-as-nails Gracie Hart is the only female Agent at the office,
she's chosen to go undercover as the contestant from New Jersey.

5
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Gracie Hart, played by Sandra Bullock.

6
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:06,000
Eric Matthews, played by Benjamin Bratt.

7
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:36,000
Cheryl Frasier, played by Heather Burns.

8
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Victor Melling, played by Michael Caine.

9
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Harry McDonald, played by Ernie Hudson.

10
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Kathy Morningside, played by Candice Bergen.

11
01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:36,000
Miss Congeniality is a 2000 American action comedy film directed by Donald Petrie, written by Marc Lawrence, Katie Ford, and Caryn Lucas, and produced by and starring Sandra
Bullock as Gracie Hart, a tomboy agent who is asked by the FBI to go undercover as a contestant when a terrorist threatens to bomb the Miss United States pageant.

12
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Michael Caine, Benjamin Bratt, Candice Bergen, William
Shatner, and Ernie Hudson star in supporting roles.

13
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
Miss Congeniality was released in the United States by Warner Bros.

14
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Pictures on December 22, 2000.

15
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
It received mixed reviews from critics and grossed $212
million worldwide against its $45 million budget.

16
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The film earned Bullock a nomination for a Golden Globe Award for
Best Actress – Motion Picture Comedy or Musical.

17
01:33:30,000 --> 01:33:36,000
It was followed by the sequel Miss Congeniality 2: Armed and Fabulous in 2005.

18
01:39:00,000 --> 01:39:06,000
The film explores themes of undercover agent, investigation,
beauty contest, talent show, fish out of water.

19
01:44:30,000 --> 01:44:36,000
The tone is lighthearted.
